---
---

<section id="panel" class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-blue bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-100">
        Panel de Control del Dueño
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-blue tracking-tight">
        Lo que antes no veías, ahora lo ves en tu celular
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Sabe exactamente lo que sucede en tu hospedaje en todo momento, aunque no estés presente físicamente.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Graphic Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="max-w-sm rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
          <img src="/images/panel-alertas.svg" alt="Panel de Alertas en Celular" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Signals Grid -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        
        <!-- Signal 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Habitaciones liberadas antes</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Consulta al instante las liberaciones desocupadas antes de hora con la justificación registrada.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signal 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Arqueos de caja exactos</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Revisa el cuadre por turno y recepcionista para verificar que la caja cuadra al centavo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signal 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Cobros Yape / Efectivo</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Visualiza el desglose exacto entre billetera digital y efectivo físico sin confusiones.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signal 4 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Auditoría de hora real</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Compara la hora real del sistema vs la hora declarada en el cuaderno para prevenir cobros tardíos.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
